{
    "title": "Facetune: Hair, Photo Editor",
    "description": "Start editing photos & videos with Facetune, now with AI capabilities enabling world-class retouches, from instant hair color, makeup & hairstyle changing to teeth whitening & CV-ready headshot & profile picture editing. You name it, Facetune has it. Don't believe us? Try any new filters on virtually, and you'll love them the moment you see them.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude84 THE AI POWERS IN FACETUNE\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Enhance entire photo or frame at once with filters or one-tap picture editing features. Feeling creative & want to be the artist yourself instead? Our manual retouches features are no less powerful. Get the look and feel you want, effortlessly. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Change hair or eye color, whiten teeth, remove red eyes - anything you need for a perfect & unique selfie, you can find in Facetune!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f A fan of video clips? Did you know Facetune is a famous video editor, too? Retouch selfie videos with simple yet powerful effects on every frame. The best part: Edit one frame and apply those changes to the whole video instantly. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc84 Apply glam filters for pictures or effects, try on new makeups, enhance or smooth your favorite clips before posting to Instagram! \r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude9e CELEBRATE YOUR SELFIE\r\n- Apply makeup filters to step up the sass\r\n- Refresh tired eyes, use red eye corrector or explore new eye colors\r\n- Use blemish remover & let the real you shine through\r\n- Highlight or darken hair\r\n- Need a new CV? One-tap professional headshot or profile pic for the rescure!\r\n- Body skin tone editing is now available as well, to help smooth out your skin like never before - plus, you can Airbrush a tan, too!\r\n- Thin or thicken eyebrows, lips, or hair with the all-new Reshape feature\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc84 HASSLE-FREE PHOTO EDITING AND MAKEUP\r\n- Quick touch-ups or a full-on makeover for glamor shots\r\n- Take stunning photos that look like professional headshots\r\n- Easy selfie retouch or a whole new pretty look\r\n- Reshape or add glow to your cheekbones with our face app\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd84 GRAB THE SPOTLIGHT\r\n- Blur backgrounds or replace them with a new one\r\n- Ring light eyes for a studio look\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7 SELFIE VIDEOS ON POINT\r\n- Enhance videos with a face touch up HD editor\r\n- Swap in colorful filters & effects\r\n- Use video editor to add colors that brighten your background or your smile, to put you in the spotlight\r\n- Experiment with filters and video effects\r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude84 ALL THE PHOTO EDITING TOOLS\r\n- Photo editing & filters for pictures, from tiny pretty touch-ups to a splashy backdrop\r\n- AI photo enhancer and AI business photo generator tools for upgraded photos in moments\r\n- Red-eye remover, eye color changer, face makeup edits, a selfie camera, face reshape & more\r\n- Photo retouch for quick fixes that enhance your natural beauty\r\n- Test out a new look with the AI headshot generator, hair color changer & makeup editor\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 WE\u2019RE JUST GETTING STARTED\r\n- Use teeth whitening, enlarge and brighten the eyes, or fill in your eyebrows or eyelashes\r\n- Retouch your selfies, create AI headshots with the AI headshot generator, choose from dozens of free filters for pictures & peachy face makeup effects, and touch up your pretty features using AI enhance tools\r\n- Airbrush a tan effect or get an even skin tone\r\n- Edit, retouch, and refine body skin tone to make it look naturally\r\n\r\nFacetune is all-in-one editor for unforgettable results, with both precision features and automated AI enhance tools. Apply teeth whitening, retouch face blemishes, blur backgrounds, reshape chin or nose, add effects, and so much more.\r\n\r\nFacetune picture editor is a part of suite of video and image editors:\r\n- Videoleap: AI video editor\r\n- Photoleap: 3D AI photo editor\r\n\r\nCertain features shown in the screenshots may only be available on specific device models.\r\n\r\nFacetune Terms of use: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/terms-of-use.html\r\nFacetune Privacy policy: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/privacy-policy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Start editing photos &amp; videos with Facetune, now with AI capabilities enabling world-class retouches, from instant hair color, makeup &amp; hairstyle changing to teeth whitening &amp; CV-ready headshot &amp; profile picture editing. You name it, Facetune has it. Don&#39;t believe us? Try any new filters on virtually, and you&#39;ll love them the moment you see them.<br><br>\ud83e\ude84 THE AI POWERS IN FACETUNE<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Enhance entire photo or frame at once with filters or one-tap picture editing features. Feeling creative &amp; want to be the artist yourself instead? Our manual retouches features are no less powerful. Get the look and feel you want, effortlessly. <br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Change hair or eye color, whiten teeth, remove red eyes - anything you need for a perfect &amp; unique selfie, you can find in Facetune!<br><br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f A fan of video clips? Did you know Facetune is a famous video editor, too? Retouch selfie videos with simple yet powerful effects on every frame. The best part: Edit one frame and apply those changes to the whole video instantly. <br><br>\ud83d\udc84 Apply glam filters for pictures or effects, try on new makeups, enhance or smooth your favorite clips before posting to Instagram! <br><br>\ud83e\ude9e CELEBRATE YOUR SELFIE<br>- Apply makeup filters to step up the sass<br>- Refresh tired eyes, use red eye corrector or explore new eye colors<br>- Use blemish remover &amp; let the real you shine through<br>- Highlight or darken hair<br>- Need a new CV? One-tap professional headshot or profile pic for the rescure!<br>- Body skin tone editing is now available as well, to help smooth out your skin like never before - plus, you can Airbrush a tan, too!<br>- Thin or thicken eyebrows, lips, or hair with the all-new Reshape feature<br><br>\ud83d\udc84 HASSLE-FREE PHOTO EDITING AND MAKEUP<br>- Quick touch-ups or a full-on makeover for glamor shots<br>- Take stunning photos that look like professional headshots<br>- Easy selfie retouch or a whole new pretty look<br>- Reshape or add glow to your cheekbones with our face app<br><br>\ud83e\udd84 GRAB THE SPOTLIGHT<br>- Blur backgrounds or replace them with a new one<br>- Ring light eyes for a studio look<br><br>\ud83d\udcf7 SELFIE VIDEOS ON POINT<br>- Enhance videos with a face touch up HD editor<br>- Swap in colorful filters &amp; effects<br>- Use video editor to add colors that brighten your background or your smile, to put you in the spotlight<br>- Experiment with filters and video effects<br><br>\ud83e\ude84 ALL THE PHOTO EDITING TOOLS<br>- Photo editing &amp; filters for pictures, from tiny pretty touch-ups to a splashy backdrop<br>- AI photo enhancer and AI business photo generator tools for upgraded photos in moments<br>- Red-eye remover, eye color changer, face makeup edits, a selfie camera, face reshape &amp; more<br>- Photo retouch for quick fixes that enhance your natural beauty<br>- Test out a new look with the AI headshot generator, hair color changer &amp; makeup editor<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 WE\u2019RE JUST GETTING STARTED<br>- Use teeth whitening, enlarge and brighten the eyes, or fill in your eyebrows or eyelashes<br>- Retouch your selfies, create AI headshots with the AI headshot generator, choose from dozens of free filters for pictures &amp; peachy face makeup effects, and touch up your pretty features using AI enhance tools<br>- Airbrush a tan effect or get an even skin tone<br>- Edit, retouch, and refine body skin tone to make it look naturally<br><br>Facetune is all-in-one editor for unforgettable results, with both precision features and automated AI enhance tools. Apply teeth whitening, retouch face blemishes, blur backgrounds, reshape chin or nose, add effects, and so much more.<br><br>Facetune picture editor is a part of suite of video and image editors:<br>- Videoleap: AI video editor<br>- Photoleap: 3D AI photo editor<br><br>Certain features shown in the screenshots may only be available on specific device models.<br><br>Facetune Terms of use: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/terms-of-use.html<br>Facetune Privacy policy: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/privacy-policy.html",
